  "solution": {
    "text": "Primary ( $1^{\\circ}$ )-alcohols do not give Lucas reagent test at room temperature. $\\mathrm{CH}_{3} \\mathrm{CH}_{2} \\mathrm{CH}_{2} \\mathrm{OH}$ does not undergo $S_{N}1 or S_{N}2$ at room temperature."
